          "placement" : "Unspecified",
          "text" : "SRTM 1 Arc-Second DEM was mosaicked, projected to WGS 1984 UTM Zone 31N\nand clipped to Lagos State. Elevation, slope, hillshade, flow direction and\nflow accumulation were derived. OSM roads and waterways were processed to\nthe study area. Low terrain (\u22646 m) and a 250 m waterway proximity zone were\ncombined to identify potential drainage-concern areas. Road exposure and\nroad–waterway intersections were then assessed.",
